ent)]; The monument was broken in half long ago [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawulti_(monument)]; The obelisk is 5.5 metres high [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawulti_(monument)]; The obelisk bears a disk and crescent [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawulti_(monument)]; The disk and crescent were meant to place the monument under the protection of the gods (Ullendorff''s reading) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawulti_(monument)]; The disk stands probably for the Sun goddess and the crescent for the Moon god [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawulti_(monument)]; The protection is only probable (hedged: probably of the Sun goddess and the Moon god, Ullendorff''s belief) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawulti_(monument)]"}]'::jsonb),
