k of the complex) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumapunku]; The stone block is estimated to weigh about 131 tonnes [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumapunku]; Fragments of five gateways were found at the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumapunku]; The gateways are of andesite [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumapunku]; The site has I-shaped (architectural) cramps [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumapunku]; The cramps are of copper, arsenic and nickel (a copper-arsenic-nickel bronze alloy) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumapunku]"}]'::jsonb),
