day (near the village of Kozağacı, Kumluca district, Antalya Province, Türkiye) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idebessos]; The city lies at an altitude of 1050 m [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idebessos]; One coin has been controversially attributed to the city (a coin from the Classical period) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idebessos]; Apart from that coin, nothing shows the city existed before the Hellenistic period [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idebessos]"}]'::jsonb),
